      body: ["The May 5, 2023 reveal opened her three-night hometown Nashville stand: entry banners ran purple-hued all day before the announcement landed mid-show.", "Her post that night flagged the July 7 date as \"just in time for July 9th, iykyk\" — the \"Last Kiss\" date fans have kept as an anniversary since 2010."],
