      title: "1989 (Taylor's Version) announced at the final US show — on the date fans predicted",
      summary: "Blue versions of her Speak Now, folklore, and 1989 outfits teased it all night at SoFi before the reveal: Oct. 27. Fans had already done the math — Aug. 9 was eight years, nine months, and 13 days since the original.",
      body: ["The Aug. 9, 2023 finale of the tour's first US run ended with SoFi's roof lit up for the announcement and Swift calling it \"my most FAVORITE re-record I've ever done.\"", "The date numerology (8-9, and her lucky 13) had circulated among fans for weeks — one of the rare times the fandom called an announcement to the day."],
      tags: ["Music"],
