      body: ["Nov. 11, 2023: fan video caught Kelce covering his face and grinning as Scott Swift patted his arm.", "He recapped it on New Heights with \"I'm enjoying life, and I sure as hell enjoyed this weekend.\" The line stuck — the Chiefs version of the lyric kept resurfacing at shows through the rest of the tour."],
