      slug: "murrayfield-scotland-records",
      date: "2024-06-07",
      dateLabel: "June 7, 2024",
      title: "Three nights, three Scottish attendance records at Murrayfield",
      summary: "Night one beat Harry Styles' all-time Scottish stadium record at nearly 73,000 — then nights two and three each broke it again. 220,000 fans across the weekend.",
      body: ["The June 7–9, 2024 Edinburgh stand opened the UK run by re-breaking its own record nightly: night one's crowd of nearly 73,000 took the all-time Scottish stadium-concert attendance record, and nights two and three each topped it again, putting roughly 220,000 fans through Murrayfield in a single weekend. Swift thanked the city for crowds that \"truly blew me away.\"", "The stand registered beyond the stadium, literally — seismic monitors picked up the shows — and CNBC pegged the UK leg's Edinburgh windfall at an estimated £77M+ (roughly $98M) for the local economy."],
