      title: "Show 100 at Anfield — and the news the tour will end",
      summary: "She marked the milestone by confirming what fans dreaded: the Eras Tour closes for good in December. \"The most exhausting, all-encompassing, but most joyful... thing that has ever happened in my life.\"",
      body: ["June 13, 2024, Anfield Stadium, Liverpool: \"You know, this is actually the 100th show of the tour. That blows my mind.\"", "A spokesperson confirmed to ABC News the run would end in Vancouver on Dec. 8 — 149 shows after Glendale, with no further extensions after a tour that had already been extended repeatedly."],
